  "question": {
    "text": "The electron gain enthalpy (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>kJ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> ) of fluorine, chlorine, bromine and iodine, respectively, are",
