      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mn>296</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>325</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>333</mn></math> and <math><mo>-</mo><mn>349</mn></math>",
